        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Dawn: A journey to the beginning of the solar system</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-width: 1200px;\n      background: #000;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .poster {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 100vw;\n      min-width: 1200px;\n      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      background: #000;\n    }\n    .cyan {\n      color: #39bddd;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n    .title {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 6.2%;\n      left: 50%;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: clamp(58px, 4.1vw, 170px);\n      font-style: italic;\n      line-height: .9;\n    }\n    .subtitle {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 10.4%;\n      width: 100%;\n      margin: 0;\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #39bddd;\n      font-size: clamp(22px, 1.8vw, 76px);\n      font-style: italic;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .instrument-title {\n      position: absolute;\n      margin: 0;\n      color: #39bddd;\n      font-size: clamp(24px, 2.1vw, 86px);\n      line-height: 1;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .copy {\n      position: absolute;\n      margin: 0;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: clamp(16px, 1.23vw, 50px);\n      line-height: 1.27;\n      font-style: italic;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .portrait {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 5.8%;\n      aspect-ratio: 1;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      border: 1px solid #111;\n      background: #444;\n      color: #fff;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 4px;\n      font-size: clamp(7px, .6vw, 20px);\n      font-style: italic;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n      position: absolute;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      color: rgba(255,255,255,.62);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);\n      background: #111;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: clamp(9px, .8vw, 28px);\n      font-style: italic;\n    }\n    .flag {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 2.1%;\n      aspect-ratio: 1.45 / 1;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);\n      background: repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, #c92531 0 9%, #fff 9% 18%);\n    }\n    .flag.us::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 0;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 43%;\n      height: 53%;\n      background: #294784;\n    }\n    .flag.de {\n      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #171717 0 33%, #d9242c 33% 66%, #f4cf32 66% 100%);\n    }\n    .flag.it {\n      background: linear-gradient(to right, #159447 0 33%, #fff 33% 66%, #d52f35 66% 100%);\n    }\n    .name {\n      position: absolute;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: clamp(11px, .85vw, 34px);\n      line-height: 1.35;\n      font-style: italic;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    .orbit {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 15.2%;\n      left: 55%;\n      width: 36%;\n      height: 79%;\n      border: 4px solid #e60000;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      transform: rotate(-9deg);\n      opacity: .95;\n    }\n    .spacecraft {\n      left: 24%;\n      top: 18%;\n      width: 22%;\n      height: 45%;\n    }\n    .asteroid {\n      left: 47%;\n      top: 26%;\n      width: 27%;\n      height: 42%;\n      border-radius: 46%;\n      background: #35322c;\n    }\n    .framing {\n      left: 4.3%;\n      top: 20%;\n      width: 15%;\n      height: 38%;\n    }\n    .gravity {\n      right: 3%;\n      top: 25%;\n      width: 15%;\n      height: 16%;\n    }\n    .grand {\n      left: 3%;\n      top: 60%;\n      width: 19%;\n      height: 27%;\n    }\n    .vir {\n      right: 1.5%;\n      top: 61%;\n      width: 19%;\n      height: 27%;\n    }\n    .framing-title { top: 20%; left: 8%; }\n    .framing-copy { top: 27%; left: 4%; width: 21%; }\n    .framing-flag { top: 20.2%; left: 19%; }\n    .holger { top: 45%; left: 11.5%; }\n    .holger-name { top: 54%; left: 10%; width: 10%; }\n    .gravity-title { top: 20%; right: 3%; }\n    .gravity-copy { top: 27%; right: 2%; width: 21%; }\n    .gravity-flag { top: 20.2%; right: 18%; }\n    .sami { top: 47%; right: 10%; }\n    .sami-name { top: 56%; right: 8%; width: 10%; }\n    .grand-title { top: 60%; left: 8%; }\n    .grand-copy { top: 66%; left: 4%; width: 20%; }\n    .grand-flag { top: 60.2%; left: 22%; }\n    .tom { top: 73%; left: 17%; }\n    .tom-name { top: 81%; left: 15%; width: 10%; }\n    .vir-title { top: 61%; right: 1%; }\n    .vir-copy { top: 67%; right: 2%; width: 21%; }\n    .vir-flag { top: 64%; right: 20%; }\n    .angioletta { top: 78%; right: 10%; }\n    .angioletta-name { top: 87%; right: 7%; width: 12%; }\n    .journey {\n      top: 69%;\n      left: 27%;\n      width: 48%;\n      font-size: clamp(18px, 1.5vw, 59px);\n    }\n    .url {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 92%;\n      left: 50%;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      color: #39bddd;\n      font-size: clamp(30px, 3.1vw, 125px);\n      font-style: italic;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"poster\">\n    <h1 class=\"title cyan\">Dawn</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">A journey to the beginning of the solar system</p>\n\n    <div class=\"orbit\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder spacecraft\">[Image: Dawn spacecraft]</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder asteroid\">[Image: surface of Vesta]</div>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder framing\">[Image: framing camera spacecraft solar panel]</div>\n    <h2 class=\"instrument-title framing-title\">Framing Cameras</h2>\n    <div class=\"flag us framing-flag\" aria-label=\"United States flag\"></div>\n    <p class=\"copy framing-copy\">\n      By imaging the surfaces of Vesta<br>\n      and Ceres, the framing cameras<br>\n      will enable scientists to map the<br>\n      topography, albedo and color, and<br>\n      to determine their shapes, volumes,<br>\n      and spin rates.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"portrait holger\">[Portrait: Holger Sierks]</div>\n    <p class=\"name holger-name\">Holger Sierks<br>Framing Camera Lead, MPS</p>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder gravity\">[Image: spacecraft high gain antenna]</div>\n    <h2 class=\"instrument-title gravity-title\">Gravity Science</h2>\n    <div class=\"flag us gravity-flag\" aria-label=\"United States flag\"></div>\n    <p class=\"copy gravity-copy\">\n      Gravity science: the spacecraft<br>\n      transmits a radio signal to Earth<br>\n      through its high gain antenna<br>\n      that changes in frequency as the<br>\n      spacecraft&rsquo;s speed changes when<br>\n      flying over areas of different<br>\n      densities. The collective set of<br>\n      information on the mass variations<br>\n      or concentrations is called<br>\n      the gravitational field<br>\n      of the body/planet.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"portrait sami\">[Portrait: Sami Asmar]</div>\n    <p class=\"name sami-name\">Sami Asmar<br>Gravity Science Lead, JPL</p>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder grand\">[Image: Gamma Ray Neutron Detector]</div>\n    <h2 class=\"instrument-title grand-title\">Gamma Ray Neutron Detector</h2>\n    <div class=\"flag us grand-flag\" aria-label=\"United States flag\"></div>\n    <p class=\"copy grand-copy\">\n      GRaND measures<br>\n      elemental abundances<br>\n      on the surfaces<br>\n      of Vesta and Ceres,<br>\n      offering insight into their<br>\n      respective formation<br>\n      and evolution\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"portrait tom\">[Portrait: Tom Prettyman]</div>\n    <p class=\"name tom-name\">Tom Prettyman<br>GRaND Team Lead, PSI</p>\n\n    <div class=\"placeholder vir\">[Image: Visible and Infrared Spectrometer]</div>\n    <h2 class=\"instrument-title vir-title\">Visible &amp; Infrared Spectrometer</h2>\n    <div class=\"flag it vir-flag\" aria-label=\"Italy flag\"></div>\n    <p class=\"copy vir-copy\">\n      VIR measures reflected<br>\n      sunlight and emitted thermal<br>\n      radiation from the surfaces of<br>\n      the targets. Scientists extract<br>\n      the target&rsquo;s elemental<br>\n      signatures and then map mineralogical<br>\n      properties. These properties<br>\n      hold clues to the history<br>\n      and formation mechanisms<br>\n      of Vesta and Ceres.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"portrait angioletta\">[Portrait: Angioletta Coradini]</div>\n    <p class=\"name angioletta-name\">Angioletta Coradini,<br>VIR Team Leader, INAF</p>\n\n    <p class=\"copy journey\">\n      In its journey to the main asteroid belt to orbit two diverse<br>\n      protoplanets, Vesta and Ceres, Dawn is carrying a suite of<br>\n      sophisticated scientific instruments to collect data that will<br>\n      inform us about the early formation of our solar system.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"url\">http://dawn.jpl.nasa.gov</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
